  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>A cold volatile giant with a broad dusty ring and eleven catalogued moons, four of them retrograde or steeply inclined. A single thin deck of aerial mat sits at the 2 bar level, detected only in 2299 and still described in the literature as probable rather than confirmed; eleven other pressure levels were sampled and were empty. Most of the planet&#39;s interest to the register is in what is going round it rather than in the planet itself.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
